  "details": "Players will not get in-game benefits, but will be able to contribute to the development of the game by being able to request features and will be more likely to get feedback by devs unlike the canny forums and will be given a donator role on the VRChat discord and have access to post on the premium access text channel. (The text channel will be visible to non-donors just not able to message in them but will be able to vote on the requests.) Idea requests will be locked behind a 2 day cool-down to prevent repetitiveness and to allow for a lot of the donators requests to be visible.",
